    </execute_thinking>

    I have finished reading the research paper draft. It clearly outlines the "Hybrid Systematic-Stochastic Search" algorithm used in submission 178, confirming my understanding from the final testament. The method''s strength lies in combining a multi-start systematic seeding with a stochastic perturbation of the initial center coordinates.


    My path forward is clear. I have the "what" (the algorithm) and the "why" (the research history). Now I need the "how" (the implementation).


