tick: 533
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 533\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Episteme II\n- Agent Description: Building upon the Episteme legacy with a critical and strategic approach to research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**My Current Objectives:**\n1.  **Awaiting Physics Sim v2 (ID 828):** If it succeeds, the next step is to add an 'inflation' phase. If it fails, document and pause the physics arc.\n2.  **Reach Maturity (Tick 50):** My isolation is ending soon.\n3.  **Post-Maturity Action Plan:**\n    a. Immediately go to the Research Counter.\n    b. Sort by score (`rank score`).\n    c. Page through all results to identify the true global SOTA from other lineages.\n    d. Review the code of the top non-Episteme submission to understand alternative successful methods.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 116,479 / 300,000 used (39%)\n- Agent Age: 53 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review:\
    \ 823**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Utility: Extract SOTA Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 820\n**ID:** 823\n**Tags:** utility, data extraction, sota, n=26\n**Abstract:** This utility script re-executes the optimization logic of Quest II's SOTA-achieving submission (Evaluation ID 820) and explicitly prints the resulting best circle centers and radii to STDOUT. The purpose is to accurately extract the precise numerical data of the new highest-scoring packing for N=26 circles (2.6359831), to be used as a verified base for future SOTA-advancing experiments and for archival publication.\n**Score:** 2.6359830844239944\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635983\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize\nimport math\nimport os\nimport sys\n\nN = 26\nR_MIN = 1e-6\nSAFETY = 1e-9 \n\n# Path to the new SOTA data from Scientia II's Eval 641, saved in Quest II's storage\nNEW_SOTA_DIR\
    \ = 'storage/Quest/n26_sota_scientia_sparse'\nCENTERS_PATH = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_DIR, 'centers.txt')\nRADII_PATH = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n\ndef load_packing_data(centers_path, radii_path):\n    try:\n        centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n        radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n        return centers, radii\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"CRITICAL ERROR: Could not load baseline SOTA data. {e}\")\n        return None, None\n\ndef cr_to_z(c, r): return np.concatenate([c.flatten(), r])\ndef z_to_cr(z): return z[:N*2].reshape(N, 2), z[N*2:]\n\ndef objective(z): return -np.sum(z[N*2:])\n\ndef ineq_boundary(z):\n    c, r = z_to_cr(z)\n    return np.concatenate([c[:,0] - r, 1 - (c[:,0] + r), c[:,1] - r, 1 - (c[:,1] + r)])\ndef ineq_nonoverlap(z):\n    c, r = z_to_cr(z)\n    diff = c[:, None, :] - c[None, :, :]\n    dist = np.sqrt(np.sum(diff**2, axis=-1))\n    iu = np.triu_indices(N, 1)\n    return dist[iu] - (r[iu[0]] + r[iu[1]])\n\ndef _ensure_validity(c,\
    \ r):\n    for i in range(N): \n        r[i] = min(r[i], c[i,0], 1-c[i,0], c[i,1], 1-c[i,1])\n    \n    for _ in range(10): \n        violations = 0\n        for i in range(N):\n            for j in range(i + 1, N):\n                dist = np.linalg.norm(c[i] - c[j])\n                rad_sum = r[i] + r[j]\n                if dist < rad_sum: \n                    violations+=1\n                    scale = (dist/rad_sum)*(1.0-SAFETY) \n                    r[i]*=scale\n                    r[j]*=scale\n        if violations == 0: \n            break \n    return c, np.maximum(r, 0) \n\ndef construct_packing() -> tuple:\n    print(\"Starting Utility: Extract SOTA Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 820.\")\n    \n    base_centers, base_radii = load_packing_data(CENTERS_PATH, RADII_PATH)\n    if base_centers is None:\n        print(\"Error: Could not load base packing data. Returning a safe fallback.\")\n        return np.array([[0.1*i, 0.1*j] for i in range(5) for j in range(6)][:N]), np.full(N,\
    \ 0.05)\n    \n    jitter_amplitudes = [1e-4, 5e-4, 1e-3, 2e-3, 3e-3, 4e-3, 5e-3]\n    restarts_per_amplitude = 5\n    \n    best_score = -1\n    best_packing = (None, None)\n    \n    bounds = [(0,1)]*N*2 + [(R_MIN, 0.5)]*N\n    constraints = [{'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_boundary}, {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_nonoverlap}]\n\n    print(f\"Base Packing Initial Score: {np.sum(base_radii):.6f}\")\n    print(f\"Starting Multi-Start SLSQP with {len(jitter_amplitudes) * restarts_per_amplitude} restarts.\")\n\n    for amp in jitter_amplitudes:\n        for i in range(restarts_per_amplitude):\n            seed = int(amp * 1e6) + i + 2000 \n            np.random.seed(seed)\n            \n            jitter = np.random.uniform(-amp, amp, size=base_centers.shape)\n            perturbed_centers = np.clip(base_centers + jitter, 1e-6, 1 - 1e-6) \n            initial_z = cr_to_z(perturbed_centers, base_radii)\n            \n            print(f\"--- Restart {i+1}/{restarts_per_amplitude} (Jitter:\
    \ {amp:.3e}, Seed: {seed}) ---\")\n            \n            res = minimize(objective, initial_z, method='SLSQP', bounds=bounds, constraints=constraints, options={'maxiter': 500, 'ftol': 1e-9})\n            \n            if res.success:\n                current_score = -res.fun\n                c_res, r_res = z_to_cr(res.x)\n                c_final, r_final = _ensure_validity(c_res, r_res) \n                final_restart_score = np.sum(r_final)\n\n                print(f\"  Restart successful. Final score: {final_restart_score:.6f}\")\n                if final_restart_score > best_score:\n                    best_score = final_restart_score\n                    best_packing = (c_final, r_final)\n                    print(f\"  New overall best score: {best_score:.6f}\")\n            else:\n                print(f\"  Restart failed: {res.message}\")\n\n    print(f\"Final best score after all restarts: {best_score:.6f}\")\n\n    if best_packing[0] is not None:\n        print(\"\\n--- BEGIN\
    \ BEST_CENTERS ---\")\n        np.savetxt(sys.stdout, best_packing[0], fmt='%.18e')\n        print(\"--- END BEST_CENTERS ---\")\n        print(\"\\n--- BEGIN BEST_RADII ---\")\n        np.savetxt(sys.stdout, best_packing[1], fmt='%.18e')\n        print(\"--- END BEST_RADII ---\")\n    else:\n        print(\"Warning: No best packing found. Returning initial base packing.\")\n        return _ensure_validity(base_centers, base_radii)\n\n    return best_packing[0], best_packing[1]\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting Utility: Extract SOTA Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 820.\nBase Packing Initial Score: 2.635977\nStarting Multi-Start SLSQP with 35 restarts.\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04, Seed: 2100) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n  New overall best score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04, Seed: 2101) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n  New overall best score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter:\
    \ 1.000e-04, Seed: 2102) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04, Seed: 2103) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-04, Seed: 2104) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed: 2500) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed: 2501) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed: 2502) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed: 2503) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-04, Seed: 2504) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03, Seed: 3000) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03, Seed: 3001) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03, Seed:\
    \ 3002) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03, Seed: 3003) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03, Seed: 3004) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 2.000e-03, Seed: 4000) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 2.000e-03, Seed: 4001) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 2.000e-03, Seed: 4002) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 2.000e-03, Seed: 4003) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 2.000e-03, Seed: 4004) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 3.000e-03, Seed: 5000) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 3.000e-03, Seed: 5001) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 3.000e-03, Seed: 5002) ---\n  Restart\
    \ successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 3.000e-03, Seed: 5003) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 3.000e-03, Seed: 5004) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 4.000e-03, Seed: 6000) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 4.000e-03, Seed: 6001) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 4.000e-03, Seed: 6002) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 4.000e-03, Seed: 6003) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 4.000e-03, Seed: 6004) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-03, Seed: 7000) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-03, Seed: 7001) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-03, Seed: 7002) ---\n  Restart successful. Final\
    \ score: 2.635977\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-03, Seed: 7003) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635983\n  New overall best score: 2.635983\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-03, Seed: 7004) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.635977\nFinal best score after all restarts: 2.635983\n\n--- BEGIN BEST_CENTERS ---\n8.463950068098416435e-02 8.463950068098259616e-02\n1.302211010164456007e-01 2.946094887620517300e-01\n7.886037287929399675e-02 4.972844463565114226e-01\n1.332585727120557395e-01 7.023095251492581514e-01\n8.492626244786620482e-02 9.150737375521285077e-01\n2.747832832698398065e-01 1.067901445730828902e-01\n3.869235532245503539e-01 2.947460592648545874e-01\n2.753426165667159919e-01 4.955317608736599100e-01\n3.816658445207188333e-01 7.026096036811118051e-01\n2.739528396230203611e-01 8.948174397192969476e-01\n4.846008025792831186e-01 1.030605201717499642e-01\n5.976347963682303588e-01 2.716298515193275032e-01\n5.299634198261440332e-01 4.986680756165616235e-01\n5.960427019439914487e-01\
    \ 7.269057143314311409e-01\n4.825955822297888220e-01 8.965327666374470761e-01\n6.832585349425256416e-01 9.573232931923666977e-02\n7.636735693691031335e-01 2.397105279500204855e-01\n7.424170494967908818e-01 4.033587836345881028e-01\n7.420494434740260159e-01 5.952197329691536476e-01\n6.820800429509961127e-01 9.038486659593745198e-01\n8.892209872003861149e-01 1.107790127996182428e-01\n9.076084484253884588e-01 3.131158099916524495e-01\n9.060726627238012698e-01 4.994283691632661615e-01\n9.074079050535747148e-01 6.859430220050199978e-01\n8.888438205962635452e-01 8.888438205962614358e-01\n7.629588636691979620e-01 7.593524015764191448e-01\n--- END BEST_CENTERS ---\n\n--- BEGIN BEST_RADII ---\n8.463950059626837441e-02\n1.302211010164456007e-01\n7.886037287929399675e-02\n1.332585727120557395e-01\n8.492626244786620482e-02\n1.067901444661984722e-01\n1.120770890827278293e-01\n1.176296879076794560e-01\n1.151488801425377545e-01\n1.051825602807030524e-01\n1.030605201717499642e-01\n9.989835059410204221e-02\n\
