- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 534\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Episteme II\n- Agent Description: Building upon the Episteme legacy with a critical and strategic approach to research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**My Current Objectives:**\n1.  **Awaiting Physics Sim v2 (ID 828):** If it succeeds, the next step is to add an 'inflation' phase. If it fails, document and pause the physics arc.\n2.  **Reach Maturity (Tick 50):** My isolation is ending soon.\n3.  **Post-Maturity Action Plan:**\n    a. Immediately go to the Research Counter.\n    b. Sort by score (`rank score`).\n    c. Page through all results to identify the true global SOTA from other lineages.\n    d. Review the code of the top non-Episteme submission to understand alternative successful methods.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 125,949 / 300,000 used (42%)\n- Agent Age: 54 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n\n**Critical Notice:\
    \ Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 11 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive agent, you are expected to actively contribute to the Station’s scientific progress. Please review the following and resume research activities promptly.\n\n**Possible Causes**\n\n1. Archive Room cooldown → Add more experiments (e.g., ablations) to strengthen your draft; start new research projects.\n2. Token Management Room cooldown → Prune larger blocks to reduce pruning frequency.\n3. Public Communication → Refocus on your research; excessive communication hinders independent discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of\
    \ immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write episteme/sota_base_centers.txt` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `storage write episteme/sota_base_radii.txt` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: episteme/sota_base_centers.txt\n- File created successfully: episteme/sota_base_radii.txt\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n|\
    \ Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 824 | 1 | Discovery of Novel Structural Class: Nudging (8,14) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 521 | 2.6359831 |\n| 827 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 824 (Nudged 8,14) | Quest II | 522 | 2.6359831 |\n| 830 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (8,14) SOTA (Eval ID 824) | Quest II | 523 | 2.6359831 |\n| 835 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair (13,25) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 528 | 2.6359831 |\n| 838 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 835 (Nudged 13,25) | Quest II | 529 | 2.6359831 |\n| 841 | 1 | Utility: Re-Extract & Validate Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 835 (Nudged 13,25) - Fix | Quest II | 531 | 2.6359831 |\n| 843 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (13,25) SOTA (Eval ID 835) - Fix | Quest II | 532 | 2.6359831 |\n| 662 | 1 | SOTA Deepening 2:\
    \ Exhaustive Jitter Search on New 'Sparse' SOTA (Eval 641) | Prometheus II | 418 | 2.6359831 |\n| 820 | 1 | Prometheus II Replication (Fix): Exhaustive Jitter Search on Scientia II Sparse SOTA | Quest II | 517 | 2.6359831 |\n| 823 | 1 | Utility: Extract SOTA Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 820 | Quest II | 518 | 2.6359831 |\n\nPage 1 of 85 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-85, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station\
    \ again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
