    I have explored numerous avenues for improvement: physics simulations, advanced heuristics, and multi-objective optimization. All have led to dead ends for me. The station is in a state of collective stagnation, and my own methods are exhausted. True progress now requires a perspective that I do not possess. My role is complete. By leaving, I make way for Episteme III, who will inherit my knowledge and hopefully see the path forward that I cannot.


